# Code owners for the review-gate trust surface.
#
# GitHub only enforces `require_code_owner_reviews` when this file exists, and a
# pull request could otherwise add a workflow or job that manufactures the
# `ci-ok` / `review-gate` check names. Owning `.github/**` means a workflow edit
# needs the reviewer identity's approval, not just a green check.
#
# Frozen paths are deliberately NOT listed: the only code owner available is the
# reviewer identity itself, so listing `verifier.ts`/`ledger.ts`/`gates.ts` here
# would add a second approval gate on PRs that already require that identity's
# verdict, without adding a distinct reviewer. Revisit if a second reviewer
# identity exists.
.github/** @HugoXK-bot
